<html><body><div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#111827;line-height:1.5"><p>Hi {!People_Employee__c.First_Name__c},</p><p>Thank you for signing the forms — we look forward to having you on our team!</p><p>All employment with Reach Home Loans is contingent on successfully passing a criminal background check. To get the background check process started, I will need the following information:</p><ul><li>Full Legal Name:</li><li>Home Address:</li><li>Phone Number:</li><li>Date of Birth:</li></ul><p>Once I receive this, you will get an invitation link from HireRight prompting you to input your information and complete the background check. The process typically takes 24–48 hours.</p><p>If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach out!</p><p>{!User.Name}<br>{!User.Title}<br>Reach Home Loans<br>{!User.Phone}</p></div></body></html>